author"><name><surname>Dinner</surname><given-names>D. S.</given-names></name><name><surname>Neme</surname><given-names>S.</given-names></name><name><surname>Nair</surname><given-names>D.</given-names></name><name><surname>Montgomery</surname><given-names>E. B.</given-names><suffix>Jr.</suffix></name><name><surname>Baker</surname><given-names>K. B.</given-names></name><name><surname>Rezai</surname><given-names>A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Luders</surname><given-names>H. O.</given-names></name></person-group> (<year>2002</year>). <article-title>EEG and evoked potential recording from the subthalamic nucleus for deep brain stimulation of intractable epilepsy</article-title>. <source>Clin. Neurophysiol.</source><volume>113</volume>, <fpage>1391</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>1402</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S1388-2457(02)00185-2</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12169320</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Falkenstein</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Hoormann</surname><given-names>J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Hohnsbein</surname><given-names>J.</given-names></name></person-group> (<year>1999</year>). <article-title>ERP components in Go/Nogo tasks and their relation to inhibition</article-title>. <source>Acta Psychol. (Amst)</source><volume>101</volume>, <fpage>267</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>291</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0001-6918(99)00008-6</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10344188</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Filion</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Tremblay</surname><given-names>L.</given-names></name></person-group> (<year>1991</year>). <article-title>Abnormal spontaneous activity of globus pallidus neurons in monkeys with MPTP-induced parkinsonism</article-title>. <source>Brain Res.</sou